# Uneasy Alliance: Bot1 enchants Bot2's Elvish Mystic. The Mystic cannot block Bot1's Savannah Lions (T3), cannot attack
# (T4), while the ability ({5}, Sacrifice this Aura; sorcery speed) is refused in combat. On T5 Bot1 pays {5} in its second main
# phase: the Aura is sacrificed, the Mystic is exiled (the Aura's last-known enchanted creature, CR 608.2h) and Bot1 creates a
# 1/1 black Ninja token.

